WEBVTT

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:06.365
So here's what Suki would do
in search of a mate.

00:12:06.864 --> 00:12:08.024
Can you roll it, please?

00:12:08.048 --> 00:12:09.528
Camel seeking camel

00:12:09.675 --> 00:12:12.493
Lusty beast desires
attractive and sincere mate.

00:12:12.635 --> 00:12:15.874
I'm seven feet, 2,000 lbs.,
with brown hair and eyes, long legs --

00:12:15.898 --> 00:12:17.267
and I'm very well ... hung.

00:12:22.483 --> 00:12:23.976
I'm TED Camel.

00:12:24.159 --> 00:12:26.159
The perfect desert machine.

00:12:28.239 --> 00:12:30.278
I'm smartly designed.